    "summary": "If a friendly unit has both Mission Tactics and KILL TEAM, give it [SUSTAINED HITS 1] in Devastator Doctrine and [LETHAL HITS] in Tactical Doctrine. Assault Doctrine grants [PRECISION] for attacks against an enemy unit no farther than 9 inches from the attacking unit. ADEPTUS ASTARTES DEATHWATCH and the Legends unit KILL TEAM CASSIUS are eligible. Exclude other Chapters and AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM DEATHWATCH units.",
